# VHS recording for the Square gallery
Output examples/vhs/generated/square.gif

Set Theme "Aardvark Blue"
Set Width 466
Set Height 600
Set Padding 30
Set Framerate 25

Hide
Type "target/release/examples/readme square"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Size/
Show
Sleep 1s
Screenshot target/vhs/square.png
Sleep 2s
